{
  "$comment": "Direct publisher feeds for the news pipeline, by region. 'india' feeds the local tier when the request location is in India; 'world' feeds the world tier. kind: rss | news-sitemap. pathIncludes keeps only item URLs containing one of the strings. Set enabled=false to switch a source off. Feed URLs verified 2026-10-10. Skipped (verified): Moneycontrol (feeds stale since 2024 / 403), Financial Express (410), Reuters (no RSS, blocks bots), WSJ (stale + paywall), FT (hard paywall).",
